WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,980 --> 00:00:05,980
There is one more important thing

2
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:08,180
The sect leader is in retreat this year

3
00:00:08,180 --> 00:00:11,180
The affairs of the sect are all managed by Lord Qingji and Hongji.

4
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:14,180
The two adults felt that the previous process of Chixiao Dabi was too cumbersome.

5
00:00:14,180 --> 00:00:16,180
Want to make some reforms

6
00:00:16,180 --> 00:00:19,180
Open third-level, fourth-level, and fifth-level trial fields

7
00:00:19,180 --> 00:00:23,300
All disciples enter to hunt the divine beast together

8
00:00:23,300 --> 00:00:30,530
Digging Spirit Ore, Placing Spirit Grass

9
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:32,530
Convert points by grade

10
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:34,530
Those with the highest points advance to the finals

11
00:00:34,530 --> 00:00:36,530
Details will be announced in two days

12
00:00:36,530 --> 00:00:38,530
Large sums of time may also be advanced

13
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:40,530
You have to be prepared

14
00:00:40,530 --> 00:00:43,530
Thank you, elder, for telling me that I will do my best
